<p>(2) In November 1996, INSO Corporation completed a public offering of 1,200,000 additional shares of common stock.  The Company recorded a pre-tax gain of approximately $14.9 million, or $8.6 million after-tax, representing the increase in its equity ownership in the net assets of INSO. As a result of INSO's public offering, the Company's current ownership in INSO is approximately 27 percent.</p>
